---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Cookie Notice | Gibraltar For Sale" description="Cookie and technology notice for Gibraltar For Sale. We use minimal, privacy-friendly analytics.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">Cookie notice</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">Cookies and similar technologies</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-stone-600">Last updated 8 November 2026</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-8">
      <p>This site uses minimal cookies and similar technologies. We do not use advertising trackers, Meta pixels, Google Analytics, or third-party marketing cookies.</p>
      <h2 id="what-we-use">What we use</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> Session management for waitlist form submission (if used).</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy-friendly analytics:</strong> Netlify Analytics — no cookies, no personal data, GDPR-compliant by design. Tracks anonymous page views, referrers, device type and country.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="what-we-dont-use">What we don't use</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Google Analytics / GA4</li>
        <li>Meta / Facebook pixels</li>
        <li>Advertising / retargeting cookies</li>
        <li>Session replay / heatmap tools (Hotjar, Clarity, etc.)</li>
        <li>Third-party social media trackers</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="hosting">Hosting platform</h2>
      <p>Netlify (our host) processes standard request logs for security and performance. These logs contain IP addresses and user agents but are not accessible to us and are governed by Netlify's privacy policy.</p>
      <h2 id="your-choices">Your choices</h2>
      <p>Since we use no non-essential cookies, there is no consent banner. Analytics is anonymous and cannot be linked to you. To opt out of Netlify Analytics, use a browser extension that blocks analytics scripts.</p>
      <h2 id="contact">Questions</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/contact/" class="font-bold text-sea-700 underline">Contact page</a> or <a href="/privacy/" class="font-bold text-sea-700 underline">Privacy notice</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
